      "statement": "NewTokenFlow computes the audience, short-circuits RenewType to generateRenewToken for all provisioner types, fetches provisioners via pki.GetProvisioners(caURL, root), selects one via provisionerPrompt (auto-select when one candidate survives filtering), prompts for a subject except for OIDC where the CA derives principals from the email claim, and dispatches per provisioner type.",
