      "statement": "JWK tokens are generated by loading the provisioner's encrypted key (from the CA via pki.GetProvisionerKey with password decryption online, from ca.json offline, or from --key file/KMS) and signing through TokenGenerator, which assembles jwt ID, kid, issuer, audience, root SHA claim, and validity.",
