      "id": "claim_5b8a4f82425a445caaf3e58d1b80dd78",
      "statement": "OIDC tokens are produced by shelling out to 'step oauth --oidc --bare' with the provisioner's configuration endpoint, client credentials, scopes, auth params, and listen address (STEP_LISTEN overrides the provisioner's ListenAddress) via exec.Step.",
